* ADG5248F Multiplexer Test Netlist
.lib ADG.lib

* Power Supplies
Vdd VDD 0 15
Vss VSS 0 -15
Vlog V5 0 5

* Input Signal: 1 kHz, 500 mV amplitude sine
Vin IN 0 SINE(0 500m 1k) AC 1

* ADG5248F Instance
* Standard ADI multiplexer macro-model pin order: 
* S1 S2 S3 S4 S5 S6 S7 S8 D A0 A1 A2 EN VDD VSS GND SF FF
* Channel 1 selected by driving A0=0, A1=0, A2=0, and EN=5V
X1 IN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 OUT 0 0 0 V5 VDD VSS 0 SF FF ADG5248F

* Pull-ups for open-drain fault flags (SF, FF)
Rsf SF V5 10k
Rff FF V5 10k

* Output Load
Rload OUT 0 100k

* Analysis Directives
* AC analysis to measure precise gain_db at 1 kHz, and a Transient analysis for time-domain verification
.ac dec 10 100 100k
.tran 0 5m

.end
